From: Andreas Haas <ahaas@google.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:37:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [M159] [gin] Verify context match in PerContextData::From.

Original change's description:
> [gin] Verify context match in PerContextData::From.
>
> PerContextData::From reads a CppHeapPointerHandle from an embedder data
> slot on v8::Context inside the V8 sandbox, where every PerContextData
> shares the same pointer tag.
>
> Check that context_holder_ is non-null and holds the queried v8::Context
> before returning the PerContextData, matching blink::ScriptState::From.
>
> TAG=agy
> CONV=caf30a2f-bbeb-4e57-91e2-df58640217af
>
> Bug: 589478757
> Test: gin_unittests --gtest_filter=PerContextDataTest.*
> Change-Id: I5507841cd16c2da41e5d2172ba6570d9fdca198a
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8842707
> Commit-Queue: Andreas Haas <ahaas@chromium.org>
> Reviewed-by: Omer Katz <omerkatz@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1751939}

